00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:24.180
It's a neutral colony that refused to join the Federation after the ancient national wars, right?

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.100
Something like that.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.980
But Captain Grodek sure is daring.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:34.690
