00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.240
Stay alert.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.330
So Old Earth used to be filled with nature like this, huh?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.500
It's beautiful.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.210
Truly a place worthy of my presence.{The perfect place for me.}

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.840
But to lend us a mansion and provide support for the operation,{But what kind of person is this Birmings?}

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.510
just what kind of man is this Birmings?{He's lending us a mansion, and providing support for the operation.}

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.760
I don't know.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.430
He may be an old friend of Don Boyage, but can we trust him?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.470
Even if we can't trust him, we're going to have to rely on him.{but to rely on him}

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.350
Let's just take it as it comes.{Let's just see what happens.}{lets take it as it comes}

