Really?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.110
First Woolf, and now you.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:42.440
Everyone around me asks for the craziest things.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.530
We were unable to locate Grodek aboard the Diva.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.330
It appears he's gone to see Alzack Birmings.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.330
Very well.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.370
Then we will follow Grodek.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.080
Continue to monitor the Diva.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:54.790
Yes, sir!

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.550
